\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">80</span> and 85 / 50 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">70</span> and 85 / 50 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">70</span> and 60 / 25 (ML/Def)</div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: red\"><b>Bad</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: red\"><b>Bad</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hailstorm%20Rod\"><img alt=\"Hailstorm Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hailstorm_Rod_4e9c86.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Black Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Black_Shield_7404a5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Necklace\"><img alt=\"Crystal Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Necklace_748215.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Talon\"><img alt=\"Talon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Talon_258c65.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ball\"><img alt=\"Crystal Ball\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Ball_528da7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Gardens of Night\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"93\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gardens_of_Night_d30620.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.10<br/>July 17, 2013<br/>Summer Update 2013 Part 1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Gardens of Night</b> are situated in <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33056,32346,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33056, 32346, 10)</a> and play a role in <a href=\"#/quest/the-gravedigger-of-drefia-quest\">The Gravedigger of Drefia Quest</a>. They were introduced in Updates/10.1, with the revamp of <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> and the introduction of said quest. The gardens contain some items which are needed in various quests. According to <a href=\"#/wiki/Omrabas\">Omrabas</a> the gardens are located:\n</p>\n<div class=\"NPCQuote messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"npc\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Omrabas\">Omrabas</a></span>: <span class=\"msg\">East of the Necromancer Halls, you can't miss it, just look for a lot of dark and white sand, dried trees, and priestesses!</span><br/><span style=\"padding: 0 1em; font-size: 90%; line-height: 90%; font-style: italic;\">[[{{{NPC}}}/Transcripts|Read more...]]</span></div><p><br/>\n</p><p>The entrance of the gardens could be considered to be <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33037,32357,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33037, 32357, 10)</a>, where a Blackboard reads \"Apothecary and Holy Grounds of the Dark Priestesses.\". Behind a Counter you can find several (unreachable) items such as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rough%20Red%20Gem\">Rough Red Gem</a>, a Leechbloom a <a href=\"#/wiki/Reagent%20Flask\">Reagent Flask</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bottle%20with%20Rat%20Urine\">Bottle with Rat Urine</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fleshy%20Bone\">Fleshy Bone</a> together with an <a href=\"#/wiki/Infernal%20Frog\">Infernal Frog</a>.\n</p><p>More to the south between a basin and a Large Basin there are 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Herb\">Stone Herbs</a>, a  <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\">Troll Green</a> and Leaves, a Love Flower, an Icy Skull, a Skull, Bones and a Bone Claw.\n</p><p>A little to the east is a Sign saying \"Path to the Gardens Of Night. Tread with care, pilgrim. The Dark One listens for you.\" To the south is a pond with Palms, Agave, Palm Lettuce Coral, an Alga, Swamp Tentacles, Small Glowing Mushrooms, a Yellow Glowing Mushroom, a Frog Leaf, a Sponge, a Bog Fingers Plant.\n</p><p>To the west behind some Fences you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Sheep\">Black Sheep</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Horse\">Horse</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabbit\">Rabbits</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Flamingo\">Flamingos</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Pig\">Pigs</a>. There are some <a href=\"#/wiki/Pigeon\">Pigeons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bog%20Frog\">Bog Frogs</a> which can be reached.\n</p><p>To the east are a Leechbloom, a Hairy Violet, a Love Flower, Corms and a Dreadcoil, as well as Troll Mushrooms, Bog Wart, a Dark Blue Mushroom, an Infected Throne, a Large Boletus Mushroom and an Apocalypse Mushroom.\n</p><p>More to the north you will find several Trees, including Blooming Cocoon Trees, Blooming Jade Spike Plants, Dragonbone Trees, Sunholder Trees and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Tree\">Dead Trees</a>.\n</p><p>There are also two <a href=\"#/wiki/Monument\">Monuments</a>, one reading \"Eternal Life\" and one reading \"To the Dark God\". Furthermore there are several Strange Shrines saying \"There is something slightly worrying about it.\" or \"You feel uneasy in its presence.\" with <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Circle\">Stone Circles</a> around them or a Strange Bonepile next to it. There are also <a href=\"#/wiki/Pillar\">Pillars</a> with Hallowed Bonepiles next to them.\n</p><p>There are also <a href=\"#/wiki/Books\">Books</a> to be found, see Drefia Library#Gardens of Night.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Gardens of Night Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Pigeon\"><img alt=\"Pigeon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pigeon_1a1f8f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Pigeon\">Pigeon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0